the constraint at a higher scale. Also note that the perturbativity requirement on the Higgs triple coupling,
which corresponds to $C_{hhh}/v <4\pi$ (or $C_{hhh}/SM \lesssim 16$) \cite{perturb}, can set a stronger bound on
